{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01061","headline":"相和歌辞 蒿里 · 僧贯休","name":"相和歌辞 蒿里","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兔不迟，乌更急，但恐穆王八骏，着鞭不及。\n所以蒿里，坟出蕺蕺，气凌云天，龙腾凤集，尽爲风消土吃，狐掇蚁拾。\n黄金不啼玉不泣，白杨骚屑。\n乱风愁月，折碑石人。\n莽秽榛没，牛羊窸窣。\n时见牧童儿，弄枯骨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01061.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01061","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}